sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Reconciler as WorkbenchesReconciler<br/>controller-manager SA
    participant WebhookSrv as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant TLSWatch as TLS SecurityProfile<br/>Watcher
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io

    Note over Admin,APIServer: Workbenches CR Lifecycle

    Admin->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply Workbenches CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event (For)<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Read manifests config<br/>ConfigMap (APPLICATIONS_NAMESPACE)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Manifest configuration

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, ServiceAccounts,<br/>RBAC, CRDs, Namespaces,<br/>ImageStreams, WebhookConfigs
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Resource status

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches CR status
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Status confirmed

    Note over Admin,APIServer: Notebook Creation with Webhook Mutation

    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Notebook as Notebook CR<br/>kubeflow.org

    User->>K8sAPI: Create Notebook CR
    K8sAPI->>WebhookSrv: POST /workbenches-hardware-profile<br/>TLS, K8s Admission Auth
    WebhookSrv->>K8sAPI: GET HardwareProfile CR<br/>infrastructure.opendatahub.io
    K8sAPI-->>WebhookSrv: HardwareProfile spec
    WebhookSrv-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse<br/>(JSON Patch: inject resources)

    K8sAPI->>WebhookSrv: POST /workbenches-connection-notebook<br/>TLS, K8s Admission Auth
    WebhookSrv->>K8sAPI: GET Secret<br/>(connection data)
    K8sAPI-->>WebhookSrv: Secret data
    WebhookSrv->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(authorization check)
    K8sAPI-->>WebhookSrv: Authorization result
    WebhookSrv-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse<br/>(JSON Patch: inject connection)

    K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook created (mutated)

    Note over Admin,APIServer: TLS Profile Change Handling

    APIServer-->>TLSWatch: TLS profile or adherence<br/>policy change detected
    TLSWatch->>Reconciler: Trigger graceful shutdown<br/>& restart with new TLS config

    Note over Admin,APIServer: Health Monitoring

    participant Kubelet as Kubelet

    Kubelet->>Reconciler: GET /healthz (8081/HTTP)<br/>Unauthenticated
    Reconciler-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Kubelet->>Reconciler: GET /readyz (8081/HTTP)<br/>Unauthenticated
    Reconciler-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
